msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Broj istodobnih Boost procesa koji se koriste za obradu svih RRD datoteka u Boost tablici."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj zapisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Ako izlazna tablica sustava Boost premaši ovu veličinu u zapisima, izvršit će se ažuriranje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Target Archive Rows Per Range"
msgstr "Ciljni broj redaka arhive po rasponu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Boost alat za ažuriranje dodjeljuje cjelovite lokalne ID-ove podataka susjednim rasponima blizu ovog broja redaka. Pojedinačni lokalni ID podataka nikada se ne dijeli, pa raspon može premašiti ciljni broj. Smanjite ovu vrijednost kako biste smanjili zauzeće memorije alata za ažuriranje i vrijeme trajanja upita. Zadana vrijednost je 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Maksimalna duljina argumenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Kada Boost šalje naredbe za ažuriranje alatu RRDtool, one ne smiju premašiti maksimalnu duljinu argumenta operacijskog sustava. To ovisi o operacijskom sustavu i razini jezgre. Na primjer: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ neograničeno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Ograničenje memorije za Boost i ispitivač"

#: include/global_settings.php
