msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Omogući prikupljanje statistike izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Treba li prikupljati statistiku izvora podataka za ovaj Cacti sustav?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "Broj DSStats procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Broj istodobnih DSStats procesa koji se koriste za obradu svih izvora podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Daily Update Frequency"
msgstr "Učestalost dnevnog ažuriranja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequent should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Koliko često treba ažurirati dnevnu statistiku?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Prozor satnog prosjeka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Broj uzastopnih sati koji predstavljaju satni prosjek. Imajte na umu da previsoka postavka može rezultirati vrlo velikim memorijskim tablicama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Vrijeme održavanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "U koje doba dana treba ažurirati tjedne, mjesečne i godišnje podatke? Format je HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Ograničenje memorije za prikupljač podataka statistike izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Najveća količina memorije za Cacti ispitivač i ispitivač statistike izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Provjera RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Omogući provjeru RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should RRDfile check be enabled for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Treba li omogućiti provjeru RRDfile za ovaj sustav Cacti?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of RRDfile Check Processes"
msgstr "Broj procesa provjere RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Broj istodobnih procesa provjere RRDfile koji se koriste za obradu svih RRD datoteka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check Frequency"
msgstr "Učestalost provjere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequent should RRD be checked ?"
msgstr "Koliko često treba provjeravati RRD?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Postavke pohrane podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Odaberite hoće li se RRD datoteke pohranjivati lokalno ili će njima upravljati vanjski RRDtool proxy poslužitelj."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "RRDtool proxy poslužitelj"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Strukturiraj putanje RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Omogući strukturirane putanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Upotrijebite zasebnu podmapu za RRD datoteke svakog računala. Imenovanje RRD datoteka bit će jedno od sljedećeg:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Ovu promjenu možete izvršiti nakon instalacije pokretanjem CLI skripte <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> nakon što izvršite promjenu. NAPOMENA: Ako promijenite vrijednost maksimalnog broja mapa kako biste smanjili broj mapa ili ako promijenite uzorak mape, prazne mape neće biti uklonjene nakon ponovnog pokretanja skripte <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Uzorak mape"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Koji uzorak mape želite upotrebljavati za strukturirane RRD putanje. 'ID uređaja' je zadano. Postavku 'ID uređaja/ID upita podataka' treba upotrijebiti kada imate uređaje s tisućama grafikona. Nakon promjene uzorka mape morate ponovno pokrenuti CLI skriptu za strukturirane putanje kako biste izmijenili putanje RRD datoteka prema novom uzorku."

